    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Fever to 38.3 C at home and tiredness; eating less</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Suprapubic ache, cloudy urine in the bag; no flank pain; no clots</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vomiting or diarrhea; last bowel movement yesterday</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No confusion; his assistant notices nothing different</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

